 . Open positions offered by the Faculty of Medicine Details regarding new open positions offered by the Faculty of Medicine can be found on the faculty's website. Open positions offered by the Graduate School Life Science Munich (LSM) New open positions offered by the Graduate School of Life Science Munich (LSM) up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
