vel Gain experience abroad Overview: Gain experience abroad Internships abroad 6 Sub-items at the next level Internships abroad Overview: Internships abroad Finding an internship abroad 2 Sub-items at the next level Finding an internship abroad Overview: Finding an internship abroad Travel and safety information Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Scholarships 5 Sub-items at the next level Scholarships Overview: Scholarships Erasmus+ Traineeship Programme Career Service Scholarship PROMOS LMU Additional scholarships Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal stories Internships abroad Online Job Portals for International Internships Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Career Services 14 Sub-items at the next level Career Services Overview: Career Services Partner Companies Job portal 2 Sub-items at the next level Job portal Overview: Job portal Manual Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Career and networking events 10 Sub-items at the next level Career and networking events Overview: Career and networking events Career Talk Career Marathon Meet & Greet - Learn & Apply Career Trek Workshops and Seminars 8 Sub-items at the next level Workshops and Seminars Overview: Workshops and Seminars Seminars for acquiring soft skills and application-relevant knowledge Knowledge relevant to job applications and careers Subject-specific courses Microsoft Certificate AI & IT-Security Business administration and then finally weekend! Seminars for International Students Business language courses Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home About LMU Working at LMU You are here: Academic Careers Academic Careers LMU offers attractive career opportunities and support services — whether you're in your doctoral, postdoc or tenure track phase. Take advantage of our extensive advisory services to help you plan your successful career. The right support for the career phase you're in Each stage of your career has its own challenges and requirements. Find out more about how we can help you by choosing the applicable section below. Doctoral phase Read more Postdoc phase Read more Tenure-track phase Read more Video abspielen Moments of choice What could be career options to consider? We offer you personal insights into individual career choices. Access our video series #EXCELLerate. LMU Postdoc Career Program Benefit from our comprehensive training program covering all aspects of important career issues. Register now Our services supporting your career development Many aspects play a role in successful career planning: from suitable project funding and relevant opportunities for further professional development to the challenge of balancing family and academic life. We're here to support you, every step of the way. Pathways to LMU Qualification and personal development Funding opportunities Career options Equal opportunities and family support Relocation to Munich Where knowledge is everything What our junior academics say Doctoral students, postdocs and tenure-track professors from 130 countries conduct research and teach at LMU. Here, some of them give exciting insights into their daily work at LMU and the academic topics that their worlds revolve around. Quinten Akkerman: Quantum dots for light technologies of the future Marios Georgakis: Emmy Noether award for LMU stroke researcher Liang Emlyn Yang studies social resilience in dealing with climate change Computer linguist Philipp Wicke explores how AI can understand non-verbal communication News Solar cells and quantum technology of the future: LMU researchers embrace perovskites Read more News Biostatistician Anne-Laure Boulesteix receives a Reinhart Koselleck grant Read more News Magdalena Mittermeier researches on climate and environmental modeling Read more Open positions LMU offers interesting career opportunities. Explore our current vacancies. Job Portal Excellent research conditions LMU is one of the foremost research universities in Europe, with an outstanding research record. Research Munich — a scientific hub Munich is a European leader in research, education and technology and offers an abundance of recreational activities LMU & Munich up Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
