igationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home About LMU Working at LMU Academic Careers You are here: Pathways to LMU Pathways to LMU Changing to a new institution throws a lot of new challenges at you in the process. To help you navigate the right path to LMU, we offer a number of support services corresponding to the academic phase you're in, and it's specific requirements. The right solution for the career phase you're in Find appropriate support for you, based on the career phase you're in. The doctoral phase Read more The postdoc phase Read more The tenure-track phase Read more The German academic system Understand the system so you can start off as you mean to go on Finding your orientation within the German academic system can be a challenge for international research talents. That's why we provide an overview to be sure your time here in Germany is nothing other than a success. Overview of the German research landscape Doctoral studies & research in Germany Read more Academic careers in Germany Read more LMU at a glance Read more Bring your research interest to LMU Whether for a doctorate, as a postdoc, or on a tenure track professorship, LMU aims to promote and implement new research ideas with you. Find out here if your research interest fits our profile. The faculties of LMU The websites of LMU's 18 faculties offer comprehensive information on current research areas. Read more Collaborative research projects National and international collaborative projects provide exciting opportunities for your research at LMU. Read more Doctoral programs LMU offers a broad range of structured doctoral programs. Read more Starting at LMU — welcome on board! We provide the support you need for a successful start at LMU. LMU Gateway Diversity - Be part of our diverse community! Diversity is one of our success factors. LMU actively promotes a respectful, appreciative environment. Diversity up Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
