ion guide for international doctoral candidates Choose from a number of doctoral programs Read more Find your topic Read more Secure financing Read more Tips and advice for your doctorate Our podcast series provides you with hands-on information on typical issues during your doctoral phase. Listen to our podcast series “Diss & Co” Interesting opportunities for LMU doctoral candidates Transitioning from research to good scientific practice Read more Qualification opportunities for doctoral candidates Read more Career planning Read more Writing and publishing Reference management Academic writing Thesis submission up Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
