on opens on 29 October 2026 ) Research Funding Further qualification offers Intercultural training and workshops (LMU Gateway) IT courses and trainings (restricted access) Teaching support services (eUniversity - restricted access) Certificate for Teaching in Higher Education of the Bavarian Universities (PROFiL) Career mentoring for female junior academics (LMU EXTRA) Realistic appointment-training for female junior academics (University Women's Representative) LMUMentoring Seminar for research-based entrepreneurship (LMU Spin-off Service - restricted access) Seminar series \"Transfer Skills\" (Transfer and Entrepreneurship - restricted access) Qualification opportunities at LMU Klinikum (University Hospital) AHA Academy Professional development for LMU employees Subject-specific opportunities for further qualification can be found on the websites of our faculties , research projects , and doctoral programs . Note for international junior academics: Please be aware that some of our events are currently only available in German. We are constantly updating and improving what we have on offer. Please do feel free to contact us if you have any questions! Contact Research Services Elisabethplatz 22 80796 München Directions (https://maps.app.goo.gl/sawNuPPZZvr2tYUh8) researchservices@lmu.de Send an email +40 89 2180-72280 up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
