avigationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home About LMU Working at LMU Academic Careers Career options You are here: Moments of choice Moments of choice An academic education offers you a wide range of career opportunities. In this video series, nine people report on their personal careers and provide insights into significant moments for their individual career decisions. Let them inspire you! Skip to content The postdoc The professor The returnee from industry The entrepreneur The science manager The employee in the cultural sector The employee in industry The employees in the media sector Contact Show more The video series titled “Moments of Choice – Academic Career Paths” introduces you to people who have an academic degree from LMU and/or work at LMU. In each video, we show an individual portrait for a possible career. Whether a postdoc, professor, returnee from industry, science manager, founder, or person who has chosen a career outside of academia, our videos provide exciting insights into individual career paths and personal motivations for choosing a specific career. Particularly valuable are the tips that our testimonials would like to pass on to junior scientists in decision-making situations. LMU aims for comprehensive support Are you at a crucial point in your career? Would you like to get an overview of your options or reflect on an upcoming career decision? Speak with us. Our career counselling (restricted access) offers you professional support tailored to your personal needs so you can make the best decision and achieve your career goals. The postdoc If you click to view this video your personal data will be transmitted to YouTube and cookies may also be stored on your device. LMU has no influence over how any such data is transmitted or indeed over its further usage. More information available here: LMU data protection policy , data protection policy from YouTube / Google I acknowledge that I have read and understood the information concerning the protection of my data and am willing to display the embedded content despite potential risks. 03:26\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t | \n\t\t\t\t\t        \t11 Jan 2023\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t |  \n\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t©LMU The professor If you click to view this video your personal data will be transmitted to YouTube and cookies may also be stored on your device. LMU has no influence over how any such data is transmitted or indeed over its further usage. More information available here: LMU data protection policy , data protection policy from YouTube / Google I acknowledge that I have read and understood the information concerning the protection of my data and am willing to display the embedded content despite potential risks. 05:09\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t | \n\t\t\t\t\t        \t18 Jan 2023\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t |  \n\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t©LMU The returnee from industry If you click to view this video your personal data will be transmitted to YouTube and cookies may also be stored on your device. LMU has no influence over how any such data is transmitted or indeed over its further usage. More information available here: LMU data prot