o help you define and achieve your career goals. Support for doctoral candidates Career planning events for doctoral candidates Career counseling from the postdoc level (restricted access) Qualification and personal development Read more Networking Read more Equal opportunities and family support Read more More freedom for your grant application To enable you to focus on your grant application, we offer various models for seed funding. Find out about our seed funding Mastering challenges on your career path In stressful situations like conflicts in the work environment, we offer special support. Conflict counseling and anti-discrimination up Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
