ative business venture. Learn more Support with job applications We help LMU doctoral candidates, in particular, with completing their applications and compiling the perfect resume. Job application training for doctoral candidates Read more Resume support for doctoral candidates Read more Jobline LMU — information on international applications Read more Networking is key! Ideal conditions for a successful start to your career With targeted services and events, we create the best conditions for your career and a network that brings students, doctoral candidates, and graduates together with mentors, institutions, and companies. Career options Career and networking events Job portal for doctoral candidates up Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
