 Navigationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home About LMU Working at LMU Additional services You are here: Dual Career Service Dual Career Service Welcome to LMU Munich! The Dual Career Service provided by Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München (LMU) is designed to support the partners of professors and postdocs who intend to take up positions at the university to find suitable career opportunities in Munich. We offer support in the following areas: Finding a job identifying job opportunities appropriate to experience and career stage supplying information regarding job opportunities both at LMU Munich and at related research institutions providing an analysis of the regional job market establishing contacts with potential employers offering advice on application strategies Relocating to Munich Here you will find a substantial amount of information on matters relating to your relocation to Munich, such as housing, child care & schools, visa & entry requirements, and leisure. We can help you, if you: have been offered a professorship at LMU are moving to Munich from abroad to take up a postdoc position for a minimum of three years Contact Dual Career Service Leopoldstraße 3 80802 München Directions (https://goo.gl/maps/dHHCw6zxdPLvUQuk7) dualcareer@lmu.de Send an email +49 89 2180-4075 Maria Arseni Dual Career Service Supporting international professors and their partners Send an email 089 2180-4705 (Office hours: Monday to Friday) More Wolfgang Schmidt Dual Career Service Supporting international professors, postdoctoral researchers and their partners Send an email 089 2180-4078 (Office hours: Monday to Thursday) More Carmen Smyk Dual Career Service Supporting international professors, guest researchers and their partners Send an email 089 2180-4077 (Office hours: Monday, Wednesday and Friday) More Please find here the link to our dual career service flyer (PDF, 1,336 KB) and our registration form (PDF, 372 KB) ! up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
