igationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home Workspace for Students You are here: Career Services LMU Career Services We are your central point of contact for starting your professional life: for students in all fields of study, from freshmen to doctoral candidates. Our services promote networking with companies and help you successfully launch your career. Job portal Find your next job, internship or working student position. Read more Personal counseling services Various personal counseling services for your career and job entry. Read more Career Events, Career Fairs,  Workshops, Seminars Network with companies and gain job-relevant skills. Read more Internships abroad All information about your internship abroad, scholarships and funding opportunities. Read more LMU's partner companies: Virtual Career Fair In our career network you will find interesting employers from all industries and sectors. Read more Services for International Students & Doctoral Candidates Events and services exclusively for international students & Doctoral Candidates. Read more Application tips for students Here you will find tips and practical examples relating to your application. Read more Career Mentoring Program We bring students and professionals together. Read more For employers Information for employers who want to use our job portal and/or participate in LMU's career events and fairs. Read more Career Services Portal & LMU Talent Pool Get access to all events and services. LMU students can use their LMU ID to sign up. Register here GESTALTE DEINE KARRIERE MIT UNS! - Einblicke in unsere Career Events If you click to view this video your personal data will be transmitted to YouTube and cookies may also be stored on your device. LMU has no influence over how any such data is transmitted or indeed over its further usage. More information available here: LMU data protection policy , data protection policy from YouTube / Google I acknowledge that I have read and understood the information concerning the protection of my data and am willing to display the embedded content despite potential risks. In this short film, you will get exclusive insights into our career events. You will hear directly from students and partner companies about their experiences at the events, the opportunities that arise from them – and why it is worth attending. 4:14\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t | \n\t\t\t\t\t        \t10 Apr 2025\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t |  \n\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t©LMU Career Service Dirk Erfurth LMU's Career Services Head of Career Service / Business Coach Advanced Send an email More Dr.phil. Stephan Pflaum LMU's Career Services Consultant Career Events & Services / Deputy Head of Career Service Send an email Zoom appointment for employers More Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More Team Auslandspraktika LMU's Career Services Your contact for the planning and organization of internships abroad, incl. scholarship applications Send an email More Team Job-Portal LMU's Career Services Office / Job portal Send an email More Contact Career Services Room G Z106 / G211 Ludwigstr. 27 80539 München Directions (https://goo.gl/maps/2m7bq42FsS9WhQGk8) careerservice@lmu.de Send an email Follow us on LinkedIn Follow us on Instagram Privacy policy / Terms & conditions / User Support Privacy policy LMU Career Services & Events Terms & conditions User support for our career portal Funding partners up Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
