igationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home Workspace for Students Career Services Career and networking events You are here: Career Marathon LMU Career Marathon - Diversity & Career In parallel to the company presentations, there will be exciting presentations on the topics of diversity, integration and careers. Renowned speakers will report first-hand on the importance of these topics in their companies and how they are put into practice on a daily basis. LMU Career Marathon on October 23, 2026 Enlarge The Career Marathon is the event for anyone who wants to find out all about their career options. Here, students have the opportunity to get to know up to 20 companies from a wide range of industries and make valuable contacts. Gender equality in careers Queer Career Inclusive career opportunities Learn firsthand how diverse the working world really is and how companies benefit from integration and diversity. Be inspired and discover new career prospects that will help you shape your individual career path. Use the Career Marathon as a springboard for your professional future. Join us and experience a day full of new impressions, valuable encounters, and innovative ideas! Event language: German / English Registration Location: Cardinal Wendel House . Participating Companies and Organizations ADAC d-fine Erzdiözese München Futrue Iskander Business Partner McDonald's Mediaschool Bayern Medpace START Munich SwissRe TEG The Entrepreneurial Group UniCredit List is updated constantly. Timeline Hop-on-hop-off concept: You decide when to join and leave the event. 10:00 a.m. Event Start 11:00 a.m. – 11:45 a.m. Keynote I Topic tbd 12:00 p.m. – 1:00 p.m. Networking Lunch for Students and Companies 1:00 p.m. – 1:45 p.m. Key Note II Topic tbd 2:00 p.m. – 6:00 p.m. \"Diversity & Career\" Workshop 4:00 p.m. End of the Career Fair 1 of 7 Previous Next Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More Dr.phil. Stephan Pflaum LMU's Career Services Consultant Career Events & Services / Deputy Head of Career Service Send an email Zoom appointment for employers More up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
