ionsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home Workspace for Students Career Services Career and networking events You are here: Career Trek Career Trek: Business Lunch for Students On Wednesdays during the semester, at lunchtime, we visit a company in a group of max. 20 students. You will gain an insight into the corporate world and your chances of getting a job there. LMU Career Trek: Company Visit & Business Lunch Enlarge We visit companies directly on site in a small group. This will give you a perfect insight into the working atmosphere and your career opportunities. Use the lunch together to network and get to know your possible future colleagues. The Career Treks also have a seminar/workshop character. You will gain a practical insight into current projects, plans, strategies, etc. in the company's sector. You will therefore also receive a certificate of participation afterwards. Time: Wednesdays during the semester 12:00 - approx. 14:00 You can find an overview of the dates and the links for registration in our event calendar . Schedule wann was/wer wo 12:00 Introduction Company's location 12:15 Keynote / Quick Win Workshop ca. 13:00 Business & Networking Lunch ca. 14:00 Farewell Are you an employer and would like to take part in our events? If you click to view this video your personal data will be transmitted to YouTube and cookies may also be stored on your device. LMU has no influence over how any such data is transmitted or indeed over its further usage. More information available here: LMU data protection policy , data protection policy from YouTube / Google I acknowledge that I have read and understood the information concerning the protection of my data and am willing to display the embedded content despite potential risks. 2:30\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t | \n\t\t\t\t\t        \t17 Sept 2021\n\t\t\t\t        \t\t |  \n\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t©Career Service der LMU Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More Dr.phil. Stephan Pflaum LMU's Career Services Consultant Career Events & Services / Deputy Head of Career Service Send an email Zoom appointment for employers More up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
