, adjective declension, relative clauses, participial attributes, nominal and verbal style Online Self-Study Course: “Starting a Career and Working Life in Germany” Online self-study course from Deutsch-Uni Online (DUO) Duration: approx. 100 hours Course level: B1; suitable for students at levels A2–B2 Free for students at LMU Munich. Registration. English Courses Business English Compact Future dates will be announced here. Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
