tionsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home Workspace for Students Career Services Career and networking events You are here: Meet & Greet LMU Shape Your Career 2026 The “Shape Your Career: Consulting & STEM Edition” event offers you the opportunity to gain comprehensive insight into the fascinating world of consulting and the STEM industry. Spontaneous participation without prior registration is possible. The event is open to students and doctoral candidates from all universities and colleges. Shape Your Career Consulting & MINT - 27.03.2026 Sign Up! Read more Your entry into the world of consulting and the STEM industry This day is specially designed for anyone interested in a career in consulting or the STEM sector who would like to broaden their career prospects. Look forward to a series of inspiring presentations and panel discussions in which experienced consultants share their success stories and valuable tips. Find out which skills and qualifications are particularly sought after in the consulting and STEM industries and how you can best prepare for your career path. The afternoon is all about practical learning: interactive workshops and case study sessions will allow you to deepen your knowledge and familiarize yourself with the challenges and opportunities of everyday consulting work. Take advantage of this opportunity to exchange ideas with industry insiders and make valuable contacts. Venue: Literaturhaus Munich, 3rd floor Participating companies: Altman Solon Basycon CIL Strategy Consultants CYLAD d-fine EY-Parthenon Humatica Iskander Business Partner KPMG L.E.K. Consulting McKinsey Media School Bavaria Medpace Mercer Revolut Roland Berger Weser & Kollegen Hop-on, hop-off. We recommend planning at least two hours for the day. Of course, you should attend the case workshops/keynotes you have registered for. The event language is German. Impressions 1 of 10 Previous Next © COPYRIGHT         SABINE JAKOBS © COPYRIGHT         SABINE JAKOBS Dr.phil. Stephan Pflaum LMU's Career Services Consultant Career Events & Services / Deputy Head of Career Service Send an email Zoom appointment for employers More Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
