avigationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home Workspace for Students Career Services Career and networking events You are here: LMU Karriereforum LMU Karriereforum 2026 Cross-industry career fair for students and doctoral candidates from all disciplines and at all stages of their studies. Walk-ins are welcome. The event is open to students and doctoral candidates from all universities and colleges. LMU Career Forum on May 22, 2026 Enlarge Your stepping stone into the professional world Discover your career opportunities at the LMU Career Fair! The Career Fair offers you the opportunity to connect with up to 30 leading companies from a wide range of industries. Take advantage of this chance to meet potential employers, build valuable professional connections, and get a behind-the-scenes look at exciting companies. What can you expect? Direct interaction: Meet HR managers and company representatives in person. Information booths: Get information on internships, part-time student jobs, trainee programs, and career entry opportunities. Keynote Speeches: Attend engaging keynote speeches that offer valuable insights and tips for your career planning. Networking: Connect with others and expand your professional network. Venue: Kardinal Wendel Haus, Munich Time: 10 a.m. – 4 p.m. Participating companies Sign up! Read more Academy Consult ADAC Altman Solon Bank of China Celonis CIL Strategy Consultants Crown Futrue Hubert Burda Media HypoVereinsbank UniCredit KPMG matorix Mediaschool Bavaria Medpace Mercer ProSiebenSat.1 Media SE SwissRe TEG ThirdBridge WiB Women in Business Hop-on, hop-off. We recommend planning at least two hours for the day. The event language is German. Program optional table caption Time Program starting at 9:30 a.m. Check-in, welcome coffee 10:00 a.m. Start of the career fair 12:00 PM – 1:00 PM Networking Lunch 1:00–1:45 p.m. Keynote @ADAC : Working where it really counts. Helping others is our passion. The ADAC as an employer. (Conference Room, 1st Floor) 4:00 p.m. End Impressions LMU Karriereforum 2024 1 of 9 Previous Next Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More Dr.phil. Stephan Pflaum LMU's Career Services Consultant Career Events & Services / Deputy Head of Career Service Send an email Zoom appointment for employers More up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
