he next level Gain experience abroad Overview: Gain experience abroad Internships abroad 6 Sub-items at the next level Internships abroad Overview: Internships abroad Finding an internship abroad 2 Sub-items at the next level Finding an internship abroad Overview: Finding an internship abroad Travel and safety information Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Scholarships 5 Sub-items at the next level Scholarships Overview: Scholarships Erasmus+ Traineeship Programme Career Service Scholarship PROMOS LMU Additional scholarships Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal stories Internships abroad Online Job Portals for International Internships Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Career Services 14 Sub-items at the next level Career Services Overview: Career Services Partner Companies Job portal 2 Sub-items at the next level Job portal Overview: Job portal Manual Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Career and networking events 10 Sub-items at the next level Career and networking events Overview: Career and networking events Career Talk Career Marathon Meet & Greet - Learn & Apply Career Trek Workshops and Seminars 8 Sub-items at the next level Workshops and Seminars Overview: Workshops and Seminars Seminars for acquiring soft skills and application-relevant knowledge Knowledge relevant to job applications and careers Subject-specific courses Microsoft Certificate AI & IT-Security Business administration and then finally weekend! Seminars for International Students Business language courses Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Q4 Internship Flash Meet & Greet LMU Karriereforum Working here & abroad: your international career in Bavaria Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Personal advice Career mentoring Offers for International Students Ambassador Program Internships abroad Cultural & sporting events Our services for employers Privacy policy career events & services User-Support for our portal Application tips for students Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene News and events Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Language version Deutsch Switch to German / Zur deutschen Sprachversion back zur vorherigen Navigationsebene Menu open Menu close You are in the following website hierarchy: Home Workspace for Students Career Services You are here: Cultural & sporting events Career Community: Cultural & sporting events At our cultural and sporting events we invite you to hang out in a relaxed environment and meet our LMU corporate partners, mentors, alumni, as well as other students. Cultural events Join us at the theater, an art show or music event. As a member of our Career Community you'll be invited to enjoy buzzing networking buffets, receive tickets for VIP seats and backstage passes and hook up with trending artists and art directors. Members of our Career Community won't need to spend a single dime. Holz oder Eisen? Karriere heißt Entscheidungen treffen (in German) Registration form Read more Please find mor information on our German Event-Site . German listening skills B2 are recommended to attend this event. Golf Community Our Golf Community is where LMU students, alumni, lecturers, mentors, corporate partners and supporters hang out together. And you don't even need to play golf to be part of it. The right attitude is a must: You should be open to making new contacts spanning your studies, work and career. You should be willing to actively coordinate and take part in shared community events. ...And for those non-golfers, you should be bold enough to try out at least one golf course. The rest is up to you. If you would like to become part of the LMU Golf Community, apply for membership by reaching out to us via our social media group on LinkedIn . Be sure to tell us about your connection to LMU Munich and why you want to join us. LMU Golf Community membership is free of charge. Participation in our joint networking events, workshops, golf rounds, golf courses or community excursions may incur some personal costs. Regarding additional charges for events, you can expect to be informed in advance via email so that you can then decide whether or not you wish to participate. We are looking forward to hearing from you! Are you an employer and would like to take part in our events? Dirk Erfurth LMU's Career Services Head of Career Service / Business Coach Advanced Send an email More Johanna Uitz, M.A. LMU's Career Services Consultant for Internationalization & Employability / project manager FIT-LMU International Careers, Events & Seminars, Mentoring, Employer Services Send an email More up Share To share copy Link Share on Facebook Share on Bluesky Share on LinkedIn Related links Home Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Routing Facebook Bluesky Instagram LinkedIn Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München Geschwister-Scholl-Platz 1 D-80539 München Tel: +49 89 2180-0 Fax: +49 89 2180-2322 Related links Sitemap Privacy policy Imprint Accessibility Press Room LMU Shop LMU München © 2021 What are you looking for? main website all LMU sites More information about Google data transfer in LMU's Privacy Policy. close Schließen"
